    <!--
    In MySQL, you can register a source connector first and then create tables afterward.
    In Scylla, however, the table must be created in advance before registering the source connector.
    The keyspace itself is created by the scylla-keyspace-init container, not here, so Liquibase
    always connects to an existing keyspace and has somewhere to keep its own tracking tables.
    -->

